// Source: xkeyboard-config symbols/ma, variant "tifinagh" (IRCAM standard), rows AD, AC, AB
// https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xkeyboard-config/xkeyboard-config/-/blob/master/symbols/ma
// Level 1 is the key, level 2 (Shift) is the emphatic where xkb has one. AD11's ⵯ ends the last row,
// as the Kabyle AZERTY ends it with its seventh key.
